Files: sqlite3mc_amalgamation.c/.h (SQLite with the ciphers), sqlite3.h and sqlite3ext.h (the
original SQLite headers, as shipped in the zip). The zip's shell3mc_amalgamation.c and README.md
are not kept. The name is not VERSION: this folder is on include paths, and on a case-insensitive
file system #include <version> (C++20) would find that file.
